    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I thought we were having a normal podcast\u2026\nnext thing I know we\u2019re comparing DMT experiences. \ud83d\ude02\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2036302798053318709",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:43:14+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I\u2019ve barely had Taco Bell in my life... Don't Judge me. \ud83d\ude02\n\nBut the point is, the ads don\u2019t work on me.\nMy brain\u2019s like, \"We don\u2019t do that here.\u201d\n\nMeanwhile, show me ice cream once and I\u2019m already in the car.\n\nThere is a reason for that...\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2035811250064531599",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-22T20:10:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What if the problem isn\u2019t your focus\u2026 but what you\u2019ve been practicing your whole life?\n\nWe\u2019ve trained our brains to jump between apps, notifications, and distractions, and now we think something is \u201cwrong\u201d with us.\n\nThis completely flipped how I see productivity, attention, and even ADHD.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 If this hit you, the full conversation goes WAY deeper. Watch the full episode on YouTube.\n#WhatNowPodcast #WhatNowWithTrevorNoah\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2035467736793460850",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-21T21:25:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Lost luggage, culture shock\u2026\nand a lesson I didn\u2019t expect.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2035129258440364356",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-20T23:00:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I grew up thinking one thing\u2026\nand I was completely wrong.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2034774418409308172",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-19T23:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Say the same thing in English\u2026 it\u2019s normal.\nSay it in Russian? It sounds like a threat. \ud83d\ude05\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2034404484882088321",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-18T23:00:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The way we define happiness might be the problem.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2034093016651337986",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-18T02:22:21+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Hey Chandler, I\u2019m adding a third show. \nYes, you heard that right. A new date has just been added. Don\u2019t miss your chance to see me live.\n\nPresale: March 17 @ 10AM MST\nCode: SUMMER\n\nGeneral On Sale: March 20 @ 10AM MST\n\nSee you there!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2033936400404615374",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-17T16:00:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Get your tickets here: ticketmaster.com/event/19006\u2026\nPresale Code: SUMMER",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2034038847294849193",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-17T22:47:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Remember when they tried to change the $20 bill? \ud83d\ude05\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2033815895819288768",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-17T08:01:10+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Let me tell you something: Fame won\u2019t make you happy. \n\nMost people think fame will make them happy.\n\nBut according to Arthur C. Brooks, fame often creates the opposite effect.\n\nWatch the full episode on my YouTube channel to understand the real science of happiness.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2033301210787414237",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-15T21:56:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
